<article class="env-lemma" id="0FJC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FJC">Lemma <span data-tag="0FJC">15.120.3</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ 0 \ar[r] &  M' \ar[r] \ar[d]^ u &  M \ar[r] \ar[d]^ v &  M'' \ar[r] \ar[d]^ w &  0 \\  0 \ar[r] &  K' \ar[r] &  K \ar[r] &  K'' \ar[r] &  0 }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a commutative diagram of finite projective $R$-modules whose vertical arrows are isomorphisms. Then we get a commutative diagram of isomorphisms </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ \det (M') \otimes \det (M'') \ar[r]_-\gamma \ar[d]_{\det (u) \otimes \det (w)} &  \det (M) \ar[d]^{\det (v)} \\  \det (K') \otimes \det (K'') \ar[r]^-\gamma &  \det (K) }  \]
</div>
  <p> where the horizontal arrows are the ones constructed in Lemma <a href="/tag/0FJB" data-tag="0FJB">15.120.2</a>. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Omitted. Hint: use the second construction of the maps $\gamma $ in Lemma <a href="/tag/0FJB" data-tag="0FJB">15.120.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>